# Chinese translation, generated from the project's translation table.

msg-revol04-0 = 
    不难发现有人在议论地方政治。你大致了解到，$PlaceName $Support 的民众渴望政府变革。再花些时间，便可探得更详尽的消息。你询问关于……<br><p><p><opt>...<indent>各公会的态度。<br><p><opt>...<indent>商人与银行家的态度。<br><p><opt>...<indent>教士与民众的态度。<br><p><opt>...<indent>政府活动。<br><p><opt>...<indent>叛乱活动。<br><opt>5<br><opt>6<br><opt>7<br><opt>8<br><p><opt>...<indent>别无他事，闲聊已足。<br>
msg-revol04-1 = 
    在$marketplace逗留良久之人，乃你最佳之消息来源。彼等谓：<br>     local merchants $Support changes in the city government<br>     <if-1>he Hanseatic League members $Support1 changes<endif>     <if-2>he Fugger bankers $Support2 changes<endif>     <if-3>he Medici bank representatives $Support3 changes<endif>     and foreign traders $Support4 changes.
msg-revol04-2 = 
    平信徒助理难免会无意间听到主教们的闲谈。从中，你得知<br>     the priests of the $cityChurch $Support2 changes in the city government<br>     <if-1>he bishop and clerics of the $cathedral, the cathedral, $Support3 changes<endif>     and that the abbot and monks of the $monastery $Support1 changes.<br><p>
    此外，政府的整体公共$Support也在发生变化。
msg-revol04-3 = 
    许多公会的学徒与工匠口无遮拦，尤以饮酒时为甚。谈及市政府的变革时<br>     <if-1>he blacksmiths $Support changes<endif>     <if-2>he swordsmiths $Support1 changes<endif>     <if-3>he armorers $Support2 changes<endif>     <if-4>he bowyers and gunsmiths $Support3 changes<endif>     <if-5>he artisans and tinkers $Support4 changes<endif>     <if-6>nd the clothmakers $Support5 changes<endif>
msg-revol04-4 = 
    据说$CityLordTitle的特工可能在接下来的几天内采取决定性行动。
msg-revol04-5 = 
    不少人相信，$CityLordTitle将在一日内逮捕某些叛逆者。问题是，当城卫将他们锁拿带走时，民众会袖手旁观吗？
msg-revol04-6 = 
    据称乃$CityLordTitle政治组织者的$NamedOneName宅邸，几近毁于劫掠。有人谓此乃政府无力对抗叛军之明证。
msg-revol04-7 = 
    昨夜，$NamedTwoName宅遭官府突袭，家毁人散，家人惊恐。拥戴$CityLordTitle者谓此乃警告，官府犹宽纵叛逆。
msg-revol04-8 = 
    全城活力四射，喧嚣沸腾。关于进军$VarString1、夺取城门的传言满天飞。据说城防军已动摇，只待时机叛逃。<br><p>
    你隐约觉察，$PlaceName的部分市民正蓄势发动反政府起义。
msg-revol04-9 = 
    众人皆言将举行反政府大集会，然其究竟今日成行抑或明日方至，尚不明朗。众多人$Support此等集会。
msg-revol04-10 = 
    As you listen to people debate the politics of various guilds, you discover an interesting undercurrent: the senior master of the $GuildName guild has an unsavory reputation.{" "}
msg-revol04-11 = 
    当你聆听众人议论$PlaceName政事，发现一个有趣的现象：几乎人人对$ChurchType的精神领袖评价极低。不知这是否只是寻常的教士贪腐之怨，抑或另有隐情。
msg-revol04-12 = 
    当你聆听众人议论政事，察觉一股暗流。当地几乎无人不厌恶$MerchantType的首领。许多人认为此人尤为不端且危险。<br>
msg-revol04-13 = 
    Everyone is talking about how the city guardsmen have just arrested $NamedTwoName, a respected citizen. Some people talk about getting together and rescuing him from the guardsmen.{" "}
msg-revol04-14 = 
    全城骚动。街头群集游行，抗议$CityLordTitle的政策。各地政论纷争不绝。
msg-revol04-15 = 
    人们公开说，$NamedOneName是$CityLordTitle的政治组织者，并正在招募大量帮手和支持者。
msg-revol04-16 = 
    Everyone knows that $NamedTwoName is the ringleader of the anti-government forces, and that he is hiring helpers. The debate is whether $NamedTwoName is a true patriot, or a treacherous traitor to the city.{" "}
msg-revol04-17 = 
    人人都在议论城卫队在他被捕后未能守住$NamedTwoName。一大群市民拦住了卫队和他们的囚犯，随后逼迫他们将其释放。大多数人认为$CityLordTitle的政权已无力维持，恐怕难以再支撑多久。
msg-revol04-18 = 
    众人皆言，城卫终于驱散了那支近日瘫痪全城的抗议人群。$CityLordTitle的政权显得稳固。许多人预计，叛乱首领们将很快被逮捕。
msg-revol04-19 = 
    政府组织者$NamedOneName的宅邸昨夜遇袭。然其忠仆击退暴徒。众皆疑此乃政治迫害。
msg-revol04-20 = 
    著名政治煽动者$NamedTwoName的宅邸昨夜遭袭。暴徒虽被驱离，然多以为系政府所为。
